      "description": "Make your iPhone battery look more personal with Emoji Battery Charging. Choose a playful battery icon for the status-bar area, then pick a charging theme that fits your mood.\n\nDIY BATTERY\nBrowse a variety of decorative battery icons created to complement the status-bar area of your iPhone. Switch styles whenever you want a cute, colorful, minimal, or expressive new look.\n\nDIY CHARGING\nChoose a custom charging visual from a diverse theme collection. Refresh the look of your charging moments and match it with your current phone style.\n\nMADE FOR EASY PERSONALIZATION\n• Explore multiple battery icon themes\n• Choose a design that fits your mood\n• Preview different battery looks\n• Browse custom charging themes\n• Refresh your style whenever you like\n\nEmoji Battery Charging focuses on two simple ways to personalize your iPhone: decorative battery icons and themed charging visuals. Pick a look, preview it, and make everyday battery moments feel more like you.\n\nImportant: The app provides decorative designs for the battery/status-bar area and does not replace or modify Apple's native iOS system battery icon.\n\nPrivacy Policy: https://sites.google.com/leansoft.io/emoji-battery-charging/home\nTerms of Use: https://www.apple.com/legal/internet-services/itunes/dev/stdeula/",
